WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.385 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:44.385 --> 01:47.105
Lady Li, the Empress Dowager has urgently summoned Noble Lady Wu'an.

5
01:47.705 --> 01:49.665
If Her Majesty discovers the truth,

6
01:49.745 --> 01:51.865
Lady Rao will surely be charged with deceiving the sovereign.

7
01:52.865 --> 01:53.825
I know I've sinned.

8
01:54.425 --> 01:56.265
I deserve death!

9
01:56.345 --> 01:57.305
Good.

10
01:57.945 --> 02:02.145
If you confess and name the mastermind,

11
02:02.865 --> 02:05.905
I can show leniency and spare your life.

12
02:07.265 --> 02:08.905
Her Majesty is seeing Noble Lady Wu'an.

13
02:08.985 --> 02:10.665
-Your Ladyship, please wait here. -Noble Lady Wu'an is here.

14
02:10.744 --> 02:12.145
Her Majesty will surely summon Her Ladyship.

15
02:12.225 --> 02:13.105
Step aside at once.

16
02:13.625 --> 02:17.665
I previously insisted that Han Liao answer for his frame-up,

17
02:17.745 --> 02:18.665
CHANGLE PALACE

18
02:18.745 --> 02:20.065
which inevitably implicated Prince Rong

19
02:20.705 --> 02:22.545
and incurred Your Majesty's wrath.

20
02:22.625 --> 02:24.745
I deeply regret it.

21
02:24.825 --> 02:25.985
But the Lu family has served with utter devotion

22
02:26.065 --> 02:27.265
and is revered by the people.

23
02:27.345 --> 02:29.505
If such a treacherous villain went unpunished,

24
02:30.025 --> 02:31.545
loyal ministers and generals would lose heart,

25
02:32.225 --> 02:34.585
and both imperial dignity and the law would be undermined.

26
02:35.185 --> 02:37.585
His Majesty set aside family ties and ruled impartially.

27
02:38.345 --> 02:40.025
That is true concern for his brother,

28
02:40.705 --> 02:43.785
sparing Prince Rong from condemnation by the people.

29
02:43.865 --> 02:45.945
You certainly have a glib tongue.

30
02:47.225 --> 02:48.905
That's not what I'm asking about.

31
02:53.985 --> 02:56.665
-So that's what this is about. -What is?

32
02:57.705 --> 03:00.545
Before I came to the palace, the Duke summoned me personally.

33
03:01.145 --> 03:02.545
Fearing Your Majesty might turn your anger on me,

34
03:02.625 --> 03:05.625
he insisted on bringing the entire Lu clan to the palace gates to seek justice.

35
03:06.145 --> 03:07.225
I reassured him

36
03:07.825 --> 03:10.665
that Your Majesty was wise and magnanimous,

37
03:10.745 --> 03:13.345
that you knew His Majesty's judgment was farsighted,

38
03:13.425 --> 03:17.145
so you wouldn't possibly punish an innocent woman over this one case.

39
03:17.865 --> 03:20.625
What's all this nonsense you're going on about?

40
03:21.145 --> 03:22.505
Well said.

41
03:25.345 --> 03:26.225
Step aside.

42
03:33.425 --> 03:35.145
Greetings, Your Majesty.

43
03:35.225 --> 03:37.305
May Your Majesty enjoy endless joy.

44
03:38.705 --> 03:40.465
You've only just been made Lady of Bright Deportment,

45
03:40.545 --> 03:41.905
and already you've forgotten your bounds.

46
03:42.545 --> 03:44.425
You even dare to barge into my palace now?

47
03:45.585 --> 03:46.985
Your Majesty,

48
03:47.505 --> 03:50.345
I heard Noble Lady Wu'an was suddenly summoned to the palace.

49
03:50.425 --> 03:53.105
I assumed Your Majesty took pity on us, mother and daughter,

50
03:53.185 --> 03:54.465
for being apart for so many days,

51
03:54.545 --> 03:56.865
and called her here so we could reunite.

52
03:56.945 --> 03:59.265
I was so delighted that I forgot my manners.

53
03:59.345 --> 04:01.065
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

54
04:03.785 --> 04:06.705
Since you're here, stay and listen.

55
04:08.865 --> 04:13.865
Lately, in the capital, a rumor has been spreading wildly.

56
04:14.465 --> 04:19.025
Someone secretly reported that the Wei family used a lowborn girl

57
04:19.105 --> 04:21.265
to impersonate a noblewoman

58
04:21.825 --> 04:25.425
and fraudulently obtain titles and rewards while deceiving the sovereign.

59
04:27.945 --> 04:30.225
I'm innocent! Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

60
04:30.305 --> 04:32.385
Even censors identify themselves when bringing charges at court.

61
04:32.465 --> 04:33.785
This accusation was made anonymously.

62
04:33.865 --> 04:34.945
A malicious scoundrel must be behind it!

63
04:35.705 --> 04:36.865
I don't even need Your Majesty to hint at it.

64
04:37.465 --> 04:39.425
I know who made the accusation.

65
04:39.505 --> 04:41.745
It must be that villain Han Liao, holding grudges,

66
04:41.825 --> 04:43.945
-who fabricated these charges! -You…

67
04:44.025 --> 04:46.305
To find excuses to search the Lu's ancestral temple,

68
04:47.025 --> 04:50.865
he had forced someone to make all kinds of false accusations against me.

69
04:50.945 --> 04:53.105
The men of the Lu family were outraged,

70
04:53.185 --> 04:54.305
which is why he received such a beating.

71
04:55.065 --> 04:56.225
My birth father died for the country,

72
04:56.305 --> 04:58.585
and his name will be honored for generations.

73
04:58.665 --> 05:00.465
The Lu family is also famed throughout the realm

74
05:00.545 --> 05:01.585
for generations of loyalty.

75
05:01.665 --> 05:04.985
How dare that villain utter such vile slander?

76
05:05.065 --> 05:06.065
I will never let him off!

77
05:06.785 --> 05:09.185
Your Majesty, just summon that villain here.

78
05:09.265 --> 05:11.065
I'll confront him face-to-face.

79
05:11.665 --> 05:13.905
If a single word he says in this hall is false,

80
05:14.825 --> 05:17.865
please clear my name and put justice above kinship

81
05:17.945 --> 05:19.585
by sentencing him to death!

82
05:21.345 --> 05:23.105
His Majesty knew I had been wronged,

83
05:23.185 --> 05:25.065
so he sentenced that man to hard labor.

84
05:25.945 --> 05:27.985
He bowed and begged for mercy.

85
05:28.065 --> 05:29.625
He even offered gold to buy his way out.

86
05:30.145 --> 05:32.145
So it was all an act.

87
05:32.945 --> 05:34.465
How I regret it.

88
05:35.145 --> 05:37.825
Had I known he was still scheming and utterly unrepentant,

89
05:37.905 --> 05:40.065
I shouldn't have held back with that cauldron.

90
05:40.145 --> 05:43.185
I should've just smashed that villain to death with it.

91
05:43.265 --> 05:45.265
Who knows how many lives would've been saved?

92
05:45.345 --> 05:46.505
Outrageous!

93
05:46.585 --> 05:47.665
Exactly! Outrageous!

94
05:48.345 --> 05:51.305
What a treacherous, shameless villain!

95
05:51.385 --> 05:54.265
No wonder Your Majesty is indignant on my behalf.

96
05:54.825 --> 05:57.465
Everyone knows Your Majesty is wise and just,

97
05:57.545 --> 05:58.425
never showing favoritism.

98
05:58.505 --> 06:02.065
You would never believe his slander against an innocent woman.

99
06:02.585 --> 06:04.705
When I next see His Majesty,

100
06:04.785 --> 06:07.465
I'll lodge a serious complaint against him and have him flogged half to death!

101
06:13.185 --> 06:16.105
I've been falsely accused and lost my composure.

102
06:16.185 --> 06:17.625
Please forgive me!

103
06:18.425 --> 06:20.185
-You… -You silly girl,

104
06:20.265 --> 06:22.385
you're far too guileless.

105
06:22.465 --> 06:23.425
Get up.

106
06:26.945 --> 06:27.785
Her Majesty summoned you

107
06:27.865 --> 06:31.465
simply because she wanted to meet the newly titled Noble Lady Wu'an.

108
06:31.545 --> 06:34.585
She was only testing your nerve just now.

109
06:34.665 --> 06:36.625
The memorials denouncing the Han family

110
06:36.705 --> 06:38.065
weigh over 120 jin.

111
06:38.145 --> 06:39.945
The Xuanshi Palace can barely hold them all.

112
06:40.025 --> 06:42.665
If Han Liao dares slander you again,

113
06:42.745 --> 06:45.145
His Majesty will surely punish the Han family severely.

114
06:47.065 --> 06:50.065
Rao, His Majesty has made you a Noble Lady.

115
06:50.745 --> 06:52.265
You should go thank him for his grace.

116
07:00.065 --> 07:01.465
After paying my respects to Your Majesty,

117
07:01.985 --> 07:04.265
I should indeed go to Xuanshi Palace to thank His Majesty.

118
07:04.945 --> 07:07.745
Lady Li, you've grown very bold.

119
07:08.345 --> 07:10.305
You're even giving orders in my palace now?

120
07:11.305 --> 07:12.385
I wouldn't dare.

121
07:12.465 --> 07:13.665
Please instruct me, Your Majesty.

122
07:21.785 --> 07:22.865
I'm tired.

123
07:34.665 --> 07:35.785
Thank you for the gift, Your Majesty.

124
07:36.825 --> 07:38.665
All this noise is giving me a headache.

125
07:39.785 --> 07:41.865
Take your daughter and go.

126
07:47.065 --> 07:48.225
-Thank you, Your Majesty. -Thank you, Your Majesty.

127
08:15.905 --> 08:17.305
CHANGLE PALACE

128
08:34.385 --> 08:35.465
Mother,

129
08:35.545 --> 08:37.865
you never should've listened to Han Liao's slander.

130
08:37.945 --> 08:40.425
He stormed the Lu family's ancestral temple

131
08:40.505 --> 08:42.065
and was beaten half to death.

132
08:42.144 --> 08:43.865
The entire capital sees him as a joke now.

133
08:43.945 --> 08:46.865
I summoned that Wei Rao because I wasn't sure

134
08:48.385 --> 08:50.345
whether to believe it.

135
08:51.625 --> 08:56.265
Lady Li and her daughter don't look much alike.

136
08:56.785 --> 08:59.465
They say Lady Wei Rao takes after her father.

137
08:59.985 --> 09:02.065
She must resemble her father's side of the family.

138
09:04.305 --> 09:07.185
That rude and uncouth manner of hers,

139
09:07.265 --> 09:08.905
that willful, arrogant tone,

140
09:09.505 --> 09:12.825
and her deceitful, scheming nature…

141
09:12.905 --> 09:15.545
She's exactly like that woman.

142
09:16.945 --> 09:19.705
Shameless and impossible to reason with.

143
09:20.745 --> 09:22.905
She must be her own daughter.

144
09:23.825 --> 09:25.465
There's no evidence at all.

145
09:25.545 --> 09:27.425
Mother, don't let the Han family drag you into this mess.

146
09:28.025 --> 09:29.865
Think about it. If that girl weren't Lady Li's daughter,

147
09:29.945 --> 09:31.065
why would she rush over to help?

148
09:31.905 --> 09:34.265
From now on, if Han Liao comes spouting nonsense again,

149
09:34.345 --> 09:36.145
just have him thrown out.

150
09:37.025 --> 09:40.465
Those two women are equally insufferable.

151
09:41.505 --> 09:43.265
Don't let either of them in again.

152
09:56.025 --> 09:59.025
Things have gone too far to undo.

153
09:59.745 --> 10:01.145
This is all your fault.

154
10:01.905 --> 10:03.105
At this point,

155
10:03.185 --> 10:05.745
the marriage alliance between Wei and Lu is in name only.

156
10:06.265 --> 10:07.705
My daughter

157
10:07.785 --> 10:10.425
no longer needs a husband from the Lu family.

158
10:10.945 --> 10:11.785
But you

159
10:12.385 --> 10:14.625
will have to pay for this.

160
10:15.545 --> 10:17.265
If I truly decide to act,

161
10:18.385 --> 10:20.665
don't think Lu Zhuo can protect you.

162
10:21.385 --> 10:23.305
What do you intend to do, Your Ladyship?

163
10:23.865 --> 10:25.545
You're a clever girl.

164
10:25.625 --> 10:29.905
You've hidden your mother and your siblings very well.

165
10:35.465 --> 10:38.065
Your mother has had tuberculosis

166
10:39.145 --> 10:40.705
for over ten years.

167
10:41.585 --> 10:44.225
She's gravely ill.

168
10:45.825 --> 10:49.705
There are very few people in the world who can treat her.

169
10:50.465 --> 10:53.945
Medicinal herbs that can prolong her life are rarer still.

170
10:54.465 --> 10:55.825
With those two clues,

171
10:56.425 --> 10:59.745
I can certainly find her even if it means searching high and low.

172
11:01.425 --> 11:02.785
Within a month at most,

173
11:03.665 --> 11:06.385
I'll have your mother brought to the capital

174
11:07.425 --> 11:09.145
to see you one last time.

175
11:09.665 --> 11:10.505
How does that sound?

176
11:17.185 --> 11:18.305
Your Ladyship,

177
11:19.225 --> 11:20.305
you're forcing me to kill myself.

178
11:21.825 --> 11:23.385
But seeing what happened in the hall today,

179
11:23.465 --> 11:24.745
you know the situation perfectly well.

180
11:26.185 --> 11:28.345
If you insist on fighting me to the bitter end,

181
11:28.425 --> 11:29.665
someone else may reap the benefit.

182
11:30.585 --> 11:32.585
A torn net can be mended,

183
11:32.665 --> 11:34.825
but a life lost can't be restored.

184
11:34.905 --> 11:36.865
Even if this reaches His Majesty,

185
11:36.945 --> 11:39.185
with the position I hold today,

186
11:39.265 --> 11:41.065
I can certainly protect my daughter.

187
11:41.145 --> 11:43.145
But in this world,

188
11:43.705 --> 11:45.785
who would come for you?

189
11:45.865 --> 11:48.545
And who could save you?

190
11:54.825 --> 11:57.225
Your days are numbered.

191
11:58.105 --> 11:59.065
Take your own life

192
12:00.265 --> 12:01.865
and at least leave your body intact.

193
12:22.625 --> 12:24.665
XIANZHUANG

194
12:24.745 --> 12:27.185
These pastries are delicious.

195
12:27.865 --> 12:29.585
I brought them especially for you.

196
12:29.665 --> 12:30.745
I don't want any.

197
12:33.865 --> 12:34.945
Look at you.

198
12:35.465 --> 12:37.905
You've been at this country estate less than half a month,

199
12:37.985 --> 12:39.305
and you've been this skinny.

200
12:39.945 --> 12:43.305
Just listen to me and come home with me.

201
12:44.465 --> 12:45.345
Go home?

202
12:47.625 --> 12:50.105
So they can lock me up again

203
12:50.985 --> 12:53.265
and make me live like a dog?

204
12:53.945 --> 12:56.545
That heartless old woman keeps siding with outsiders.

205
12:57.625 --> 12:59.545
In all the time I've been at Xianzhuang,

206
12:59.625 --> 13:00.945
has she even asked about me once?

207
13:01.545 --> 13:03.505
I see her for what she is now.

208
13:03.585 --> 13:07.185
All she cares about is reputation and status.

209
13:07.705 --> 13:10.305
She's terrified I'll tarnish the family's good name

210
13:10.385 --> 13:13.305
and has no affection for me as a granddaughter at all.

211
13:14.065 --> 13:15.745
She expects me to go back and apologize?

212
13:16.265 --> 13:17.945
In her dreams.

213
13:18.465 --> 13:19.665
All right, all right.

214
13:19.745 --> 13:20.705
We won't go back.

215
13:21.465 --> 13:23.025
Grandmother may have wronged you,

216
13:23.105 --> 13:25.105
but I've always doted on you.

217
13:28.665 --> 13:30.425
Then would you

218
13:31.345 --> 13:33.105
defy that old woman for me?

219
13:35.745 --> 13:36.705
My child,

220
13:37.585 --> 13:40.305
what wouldn't I do for you?

221
13:45.545 --> 13:48.065
Your father and I were twins.

222
13:48.985 --> 13:51.145
We were much closer than ordinary siblings.

223
13:51.745 --> 13:57.105
After he died, I swore never to celebrate my birthday again.

224
13:57.785 --> 13:59.745
I also keep a vegetarian diet and pray for him.

225
14:00.785 --> 14:04.665
You know I've never been blessed with children,

226
14:04.745 --> 14:07.385
so I've long seen you as my own child.

227
14:07.465 --> 14:10.185
What is there I wouldn't do for you?

228
14:10.945 --> 14:11.945
Don't worry.

229
14:12.745 --> 14:13.705
No matter what happens,

230
14:13.785 --> 14:16.025
I'll always stand firmly by your side.

231
14:18.905 --> 14:21.025
Aunt Heng'e, you're the one who loves me most.

232
14:24.585 --> 14:27.905
Seeing you like this breaks my heart.

233
14:28.625 --> 14:31.345
I made all these pastries myself.

234
14:31.425 --> 14:34.225
Promise me you'll eat a little, all right?

235
14:45.385 --> 14:47.225
-Grandmother. -Sit.

236
14:50.985 --> 14:53.145
Look into that girl named A-Chou.

237
14:53.225 --> 14:55.105
I've already investigated her background.

238
14:55.185 --> 14:56.025
No.

239
14:56.105 --> 14:58.265
Investigate again.

240
14:59.065 --> 15:00.425
Don't just investigate her.

241
15:00.505 --> 15:03.865
Look into her parents and younger siblings too.

242
15:04.625 --> 15:07.745
Find out where the family moved from,

243
15:07.825 --> 15:10.625
what trade they lived by,

244
15:10.705 --> 15:12.705
and which households they worked for.

245
15:12.785 --> 15:15.905
The people in that compound may be gone,

246
15:15.985 --> 15:19.585
but her family lived in the capital for years,

247
15:19.665 --> 15:22.065
so there must be traces left behind.

248
15:22.665 --> 15:26.305
I want every household checked thoroughly.

249
15:26.385 --> 15:27.625
Don't miss a single detail.

250
15:29.065 --> 15:30.145
Understood, Grandmother.

251
15:30.825 --> 15:32.265
Do it yourself.

252
15:32.945 --> 15:36.185
Remember, not a word of this can get out.

253
15:38.345 --> 15:39.305
Most importantly,

254
15:42.305 --> 15:43.505
don't let Rao know.

255
15:43.585 --> 15:46.105
XIANZHUANG

256
15:46.185 --> 15:48.385
You two, keep watch on the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

257
15:48.465 --> 15:49.905
-The rest of you, come with me. -Yes.

258
15:49.985 --> 15:50.905
Brother Jue,

259
15:53.185 --> 15:54.345
why are you out here?

260
15:57.105 --> 15:59.705
Didn't Grandmother keep telling you to stay in more

261
15:59.785 --> 16:00.705
and avoid drawing attention?

262
16:01.985 --> 16:04.505
Aren't they all household servants here?

263
16:05.065 --> 16:07.425
You handpicked reliable people beforehand.

264
16:07.505 --> 16:08.865
Nothing can go wrong.

265
16:09.785 --> 16:12.145
Besides, I'm wearing a veil.

266
16:12.745 --> 16:14.585
I'm only taking a stroll in the garden.

267
16:14.665 --> 16:16.185
What could possibly happen?

268
16:16.705 --> 16:18.705
You forbid me from doing this and that.

269
16:18.785 --> 16:19.905
I'm about to die from boredom.

270
16:19.985 --> 16:21.145
Fine.

271
16:21.665 --> 16:23.025
As long as you don't leave Xianzhuang,

272
16:23.105 --> 16:24.345
you may walk around as you please.

273
16:25.785 --> 16:27.385
You seem to be in a hurry, Brother Jue.

274
16:27.905 --> 16:29.345
Where are you going?

275
16:31.985 --> 16:32.985
It's the eighth month.

276
16:33.065 --> 16:34.505
Taxes to collect in the countryside

277
16:34.585 --> 16:35.785
and household registers to verify.

278
16:35.865 --> 16:36.745
There's a lot to do.

279
16:37.665 --> 16:40.305
I'm taking some men to help. I have to go.

280
16:44.705 --> 16:45.545
Let's go.

281
16:58.425 --> 16:59.425
Yufeng.

282
17:01.225 --> 17:03.545
I was just going to see Mother.

283
17:03.625 --> 17:04.825
Would you like to come with me?

284
17:06.145 --> 17:06.985
Come with me.

285
17:12.985 --> 17:14.184
Everyone, leave us.

286
17:22.905 --> 17:25.785
You've been coming here every day to pester Mother,

287
17:25.865 --> 17:28.424
weeping and begging her to bring Rao back.

288
17:28.505 --> 17:31.145
But you suddenly stopped coming these past few days.

289
17:31.225 --> 17:32.705
I'm almost not used to it.

290
17:32.785 --> 17:35.465
May I ask what you've been busy with?

291
17:36.825 --> 17:39.025
Who upset you, Yufeng?

292
17:39.105 --> 17:40.305
I'll have them beaten up for you.

293
17:45.145 --> 17:48.025
I went to Xianzhuang to see Rao.

294
17:48.105 --> 17:49.305
How foolish!

295
17:49.385 --> 17:51.865
Yufeng, what did I do?

296
17:51.945 --> 17:54.865
You're all so heartless, leaving Rao there and ignoring her.

297
17:54.945 --> 17:57.025
She's my brother's only child, after all.

298
17:57.105 --> 18:00.785
I'm her aunt. Who could fault me for visiting and comforting her?

299
18:00.865 --> 18:03.425
Xianzhuang belongs to the Zhou family, after all,

300
18:03.505 --> 18:05.945
and everyone there answers to Lady Li.

301
18:06.025 --> 18:09.465
The more often you visit and the closer you seem to Rao,

302
18:09.545 --> 18:11.505
the more danger you put her in.

303
18:12.625 --> 18:15.665
Yufeng, aren't you being a little alarmist?

304
18:15.745 --> 18:17.065
That woman is far away in the palace.

305
18:17.145 --> 18:18.265
Her reach can't extend that far.

306
18:18.345 --> 18:19.465
How could she know so much?

307
18:19.545 --> 18:20.745
Have you forgotten?

308
18:20.825 --> 18:22.825
There's also the calculating Lady Shou'an!

309
18:23.465 --> 18:27.985
She rose from an ordinary peasant woman to a titled lady with a fief.

310
18:28.065 --> 18:29.985
She's not as foolish as you.

311
18:30.065 --> 18:32.465
If she notices even the slightest irregularity,

312
18:33.065 --> 18:37.665
both you and your precious Rao will be in grave danger!

313
18:38.545 --> 18:40.225
Yufeng, didn't you say

314
18:40.305 --> 18:42.105
we wouldn't mention what happened back then again?

315
18:46.985 --> 18:48.225
My Lady,

316
18:48.305 --> 18:49.785
the Dowager Lady wishes to see you.

317
18:53.025 --> 18:54.225
Remember what I told you.

318
18:54.305 --> 18:56.305
Be cautious in everything you say and do.

319
18:56.385 --> 18:57.745
Don't act rashly.

320
18:58.625 --> 19:00.745
Every word you said came from the heart.

321
19:01.265 --> 19:02.465
I'll remember it all.

322
19:08.225 --> 19:10.825
My Lady, this month's accounts have been checked.

323
19:10.905 --> 19:12.505
Please take a look.

324
19:14.945 --> 19:16.265
I'll look at them when I return.

325
19:23.825 --> 19:24.905
No.

326
19:24.985 --> 19:26.905
If Madam finds out what happened back then,

327
19:26.985 --> 19:28.665
she'll never spare me.

328
19:28.745 --> 19:30.505
I have to avoid this disaster.

329
19:37.865 --> 19:39.825
Is the ginseng soup a little bitter?

330
19:42.385 --> 19:45.145
Don't hide anything from me

331
19:45.665 --> 19:48.505
if you truly wish to be filial.

332
19:50.825 --> 19:53.705
Mother, are your eyes getting better?

333
19:54.225 --> 19:55.385
You Ladyship,

334
19:55.465 --> 19:58.145
Imperial Physician Liu performed cataract couching with a gold needle

335
19:58.225 --> 20:00.425
and prescribed Dendrobium Vision Pills.

336
20:00.505 --> 20:02.025
It's been half a month since the procedure.

337
20:02.105 --> 20:06.545
This morning, the Dowager Lady said her vision suddenly cleared,

338
20:06.625 --> 20:08.025
and she could finally see again.

339
20:08.105 --> 20:12.225
I've been worried every day that Imperial Physician Liu was too young

340
20:12.305 --> 20:14.945
and might have harmed you by acting too hastily.

341
20:15.545 --> 20:16.825
Don't change the subject.

342
20:17.745 --> 20:22.425
I'm asking you whether anything else has happened lately.

343
20:22.505 --> 20:27.465
Isn't your recovery wonderful news for the entire Wei family?

344
20:27.545 --> 20:29.225
I'll call Heng'e in

345
20:29.305 --> 20:30.745
-so she can share the joy. -Stop.

346
20:33.745 --> 20:37.065
I'm asking about Wei Rao,

347
20:37.705 --> 20:40.625
the new bride of the Duke of Ying's household,

348
20:40.705 --> 20:44.385
whom His Majesty just made Noble Lady Wu'an.

349
20:47.465 --> 20:49.625
I just didn't want to disturb your recovery.

350
20:52.025 --> 20:53.985
The Empress Dowager summoned Noble Lady Wu'an.

351
20:56.105 --> 20:58.825
Mother, forgive me for speaking plainly.

352
20:59.345 --> 21:02.025
We've all done our utmost to conceal the truth,

353
21:02.105 --> 21:05.785
but we're only fooling ourselves.

354
21:05.865 --> 21:07.225
Once word reaches His Majesty,

355
21:07.305 --> 21:08.465
it will be beyond repair.

356
21:09.385 --> 21:11.105
With the favor Lady Li enjoys,

357
21:11.185 --> 21:12.665
she may protect Rao, but no more.

358
21:13.265 --> 21:17.065
Besides, our family has already fallen out with her.

359
21:17.145 --> 21:18.905
For the sake of her own daughter's life,

360
21:18.985 --> 21:22.065
I'm afraid she won't help us

361
21:22.145 --> 21:24.025
and may even turn on us while we're vulnerable,

362
21:24.105 --> 21:28.185
making our whole family the scapegoat.

363
21:29.545 --> 21:32.625
Mother, we need to decide soon.

364
21:33.145 --> 21:35.545
I've lived my whole life openly and honorably

365
21:36.185 --> 21:38.785
with nothing to hide.

366
21:39.305 --> 21:43.865
I never imagined I'd raise someone who could bring ruin upon the entire clan.

367
21:45.305 --> 21:47.585
Keep everyone in this household silent.

368
21:47.665 --> 21:49.425
If anyone breathes a word of this,

369
21:49.505 --> 21:51.465
don't blame me for being merciless.

370
21:52.425 --> 21:53.265
Yes.

371
21:54.745 --> 21:55.585
Governess Wang.

372
21:56.585 --> 21:57.545
Yes.

373
21:57.625 --> 22:00.465
Go to the Duke of Ying's Residence yourself

374
22:00.545 --> 22:02.745
and deliver something for me.

375
22:03.985 --> 22:04.825
Yes.

376
22:08.065 --> 22:09.265
Has Lady Lu returned?

377
22:09.345 --> 22:10.545
Her Ladyship is…

378
22:10.625 --> 22:12.105
His Lordship had been waiting for Her Ladyship.

379
22:12.185 --> 22:13.665
He even rushed to the palace gates to meet her.

380
22:13.745 --> 22:16.265
But she'd already left, so he hurried back.

381
22:28.505 --> 22:30.025
Can't you read the situation?

382
22:31.345 --> 22:33.705
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

383
22:38.905 --> 22:40.345
You still have time to…?

384
23:34.985 --> 23:36.785
What are you two hiding for in broad daylight?

385
23:36.865 --> 23:38.665
‎Shh.

386
23:41.665 --> 23:43.825
All right, stop staring. Let's go.

387
23:44.985 --> 23:45.985
Let's leave.

388
23:46.065 --> 23:47.505
You too. Stop looking. Come on.

389
24:02.105 --> 24:03.185
You wicked woman.

390
24:07.185 --> 24:09.185
My Lord. My Lord…

391
24:11.065 --> 24:12.825
My Lord, General Qi is here.

392
24:19.945 --> 24:21.665
Long afternoon naps could bad for her.

393
24:22.305 --> 24:24.265
Have a maid wake her in a little while.

394
24:37.545 --> 24:38.785
Where's Noble Lady Wu'an?

395
24:39.425 --> 24:42.585
When I left just now, she was still napping on the couch.

396
24:44.505 --> 24:45.825
Don't play games with me.

397
24:45.905 --> 24:47.465
I have serious business with her.

398
24:48.905 --> 24:50.025
Talking to me works just as well.

399
24:51.985 --> 24:54.625
Lu Zhuo, you and I both know

400
24:54.705 --> 24:56.625
Wei Rao is the one registered in your family genealogy.

401
24:56.705 --> 24:59.105
Her birth details and background must match that identity.

402
25:00.025 --> 25:01.465
As for the woman inside,

403
25:02.905 --> 25:05.905
strictly speaking, she isn't really your wife.

404
25:06.905 --> 25:08.345
I'll be frank with you.

405
25:08.425 --> 25:09.705
The Hans may give up the title deeds,

406
25:09.785 --> 25:11.305
but still held on to the lands or tenants.

407
25:11.385 --> 25:12.665
Han Liao is vicious.

408
25:12.745 --> 25:14.385
He's seized control of the only irrigation channel.

409
25:14.465 --> 25:16.345
With the water cut off, the crops are about to die.

410
25:16.425 --> 25:17.505
Tell me that isn't serious.

411
25:17.585 --> 25:19.345
This is a matter for men to settle.

412
25:20.225 --> 25:21.425
Why involve her?

413
25:22.185 --> 25:23.145
I'll go with you.

414
25:25.385 --> 25:26.465
Aren't you coming?

415
25:30.345 --> 25:32.505
Your days are numbered.

416
25:32.585 --> 25:34.265
Take your own life

417
25:36.225 --> 25:37.425
and at least leave your body intact.

418
25:46.825 --> 25:48.785
Those maids are far too lazy.

419
25:48.865 --> 25:49.745
I was only gone for a moment,

420
25:49.825 --> 25:52.425
and they just let Your Ladyship sleep under the sun?

421
25:52.505 --> 25:53.905
Your face is all red.

422
25:54.625 --> 25:55.745
Don't blame them.

423
25:56.625 --> 25:57.465
I like it.

424
26:03.705 --> 26:05.825
You can't do this again.

425
26:05.905 --> 26:09.225
Noble ladies have delicate skin and can't take too much sun.

426
26:14.425 --> 26:17.385
Back when I was little, other children, though poor,

427
26:17.905 --> 26:21.705
got to grow up in their mothers' arms and on their fathers' shoulders.

428
26:22.305 --> 26:23.745
But for as long as I can remember,

429
26:24.585 --> 26:27.305
my Ma never kissed me or held me.

430
26:28.225 --> 26:29.425
Whenever I was cold and hungry,

431
26:31.865 --> 26:34.225
I'd lie in the sunshine,

432
26:35.345 --> 26:37.065
pretending Ma was holding me.

433
26:37.585 --> 26:39.145
It always made me feel warmer.

434
26:41.385 --> 26:42.745
Once I'd gathered enough strength,

435
26:43.345 --> 26:44.945
I could get back up again.

436
26:53.865 --> 26:55.865
My Lady, Old Madam Wei sent this.

437
26:56.545 --> 26:58.425
She said it must be delivered to you personally.

438
27:08.785 --> 27:10.105
This is…

439
27:12.385 --> 27:15.105
Old Madam Wei gave me this when I visited,

440
27:16.505 --> 27:17.825
and when I left,

441
27:18.505 --> 27:19.905
I gave the jade pendant back.

442
27:20.505 --> 27:23.465
Her second son left it for his daughter.

443
27:24.065 --> 27:29.025
Why would Old Madam Wei send you this jade pendant?

444
27:32.945 --> 27:34.705
Her son's untimely death

445
27:35.465 --> 27:37.905
is the one thing she can never move on from.

446
27:37.985 --> 27:40.945
She can't forgive her own granddaughter for breaking faith

447
27:42.105 --> 27:45.865
and putting the whole family on the brink of disgrace and ruin.

448
27:46.585 --> 27:49.145
Still less can she bear for her son, who died on the battlefield,

449
27:49.785 --> 27:51.625
to become a laughingstock.

450
27:54.865 --> 27:55.985
She's telling me

451
27:58.545 --> 27:59.825
she'll help me.

452
28:02.425 --> 28:04.865
Lady Li may be powerful,

453
28:05.385 --> 28:06.865
but her reputation is not that well.

454
28:07.625 --> 28:11.185
Old Madam Wei also hates her bitterly and won't make things easy for her.

455
28:11.905 --> 28:13.945
As long as you deny it to the bitter end,

456
28:14.025 --> 28:15.665
with Old Madam Wei vouching for you,

457
28:15.745 --> 28:17.545
there is still room to turn this around.

458
28:17.625 --> 28:19.705
Unless I'm willing to sacrifice Ma and Hongxian's lives.

459
28:22.985 --> 28:24.545
There will always be a way out.

460
28:26.745 --> 28:27.985
I'll find a way.

461
28:29.385 --> 28:30.825
Let me think.

462
28:32.665 --> 28:33.905
Just let me think.

463
28:54.065 --> 28:54.945
Follow her.

464
28:59.105 --> 29:01.105
Keep a close watch on her.

465
29:01.665 --> 29:02.985
Rest assured, Madam.

466
29:17.105 --> 29:18.385
Let go of me!

467
29:18.905 --> 29:20.185
Let go!

468
29:20.265 --> 29:21.585
Who sent you?

469
29:21.665 --> 29:22.945
I have money…

470
29:24.825 --> 29:26.305
And who are you people?

471
29:28.065 --> 29:30.265
I've started going gray.

472
29:32.225 --> 29:34.025
The only comfort is

473
29:34.945 --> 29:37.025
that you can no longer see it.

474
29:53.505 --> 29:54.705
Forgive me, Madam!

475
29:59.185 --> 30:01.665
Madam, that old woman really was harboring other intentions.

476
30:02.305 --> 30:04.545
Afraid what happened back then would come to light and implicate her,

477
30:04.625 --> 30:06.105
she fled the residence in the middle of the night.

478
30:06.785 --> 30:08.625
I sent men to seize her,

479
30:08.705 --> 30:12.105
but someone else abducted her on the way.

480
30:12.705 --> 30:16.065
Lady Shou'an really is an old fox.

481
30:16.865 --> 30:19.585
She's grown suspicious already.

482
30:21.665 --> 30:23.785
Send someone to Xianzhuang at once.

483
30:24.465 --> 30:28.505
Give Lady Rao a message for me.

484
30:44.905 --> 30:48.265
You're Lady Guo's most trusted governess.

485
30:49.025 --> 30:51.545
Why did you flee the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence at night?

486
30:53.305 --> 30:54.465
Master Huo,

487
30:56.345 --> 30:59.305
my husband fell ill at my country home

488
30:59.825 --> 31:01.945
and sent word asking me to come and see him.

489
31:02.025 --> 31:04.625
It happened just as the household began auditing the accounts,

490
31:04.705 --> 31:06.145
and Madam runs a strict household.

491
31:06.225 --> 31:08.425
How could a servant like me ask for extended leave?

492
31:08.945 --> 31:10.185
I slipped out quietly,

493
31:10.265 --> 31:12.905
intending to visit my husband, then return and apologize.

494
31:12.985 --> 31:16.785
Please show me mercy and let me go.

495
31:17.785 --> 31:19.545
Our families were related by marriage.

496
31:19.625 --> 31:21.025
I wouldn't dare harbor a runaway servant.

497
31:22.225 --> 31:23.905
Tie her up and send her back at once.

498
31:24.585 --> 31:26.025
Wait, Master Huo!

499
31:27.145 --> 31:28.225
I'll tell you the truth!

500
31:28.305 --> 31:30.585
I'll tell you everything, Master Huo.

501
31:33.105 --> 31:34.785
You get one chance.

502
31:35.825 --> 31:36.865
I know

503
31:39.025 --> 31:40.705
a shocking secret.

504
31:41.385 --> 31:43.065
It concerns the lives of my whole family.

505
31:43.145 --> 31:44.625
I dare not let word of it get out,

506
31:45.305 --> 31:46.305
unless…

507
31:46.985 --> 31:48.945
unless I can speak to Lady Shou'an herself.

508
31:49.025 --> 31:53.065
Otherwise, Master Huo, even if you have me beaten to death,

509
31:53.145 --> 31:55.305
I won't dare breathe a word.

510
31:55.385 --> 31:58.625
What secret could be so grave that you must tell my grandmother in person?

511
31:59.465 --> 32:01.545
I'm afraid once you hear it,

512
32:02.145 --> 32:04.345
you'll be too shocked to stay on your feet.

513
32:08.105 --> 32:10.585
HERON LODGE

514
32:17.385 --> 32:18.825
Has Grandmother gone to bed?

515
32:21.825 --> 32:23.505
Grandmother was afraid I'd be bored,

516
32:24.025 --> 32:25.185
and invited me to play weiqi.

517
32:25.825 --> 32:28.585
She's such a terrible player,

518
32:28.665 --> 32:29.825
yet she never admits defeat.

519
32:29.905 --> 32:33.425
She got tired just now, so she finally sent me away.

520
32:37.585 --> 32:39.065
Something urgent, Brother Jue?

521
32:40.905 --> 32:42.665
There's a problem with the estate accounts.

522
32:43.185 --> 32:44.385
I'll check with her in the morning.

523
32:48.425 --> 32:50.505
You've doted on me since we were little,

524
32:51.225 --> 32:53.025
but somewhere along the way,

525
32:53.545 --> 32:54.945
you've grown distant from me.

526
32:56.385 --> 32:58.305
Now you're even keeping things from me.

527
33:01.905 --> 33:03.665
I'm not trying to hide anything from you.

528
33:03.745 --> 33:04.865
It's just…

529
33:08.825 --> 33:10.345
Fine. Come with me.

530
33:18.825 --> 33:20.145
Brother Jue.

531
33:21.345 --> 33:22.865
If you trust me,

532
33:23.545 --> 33:24.905
let me question her alone.

533
33:24.985 --> 33:26.825
-But I promised Grandmother… -Brother Jue,

534
33:27.505 --> 33:30.025
that old woman has always been sly and devious,

535
33:30.105 --> 33:31.945
Cheats above, hides below. Full of lies.

536
33:32.745 --> 33:34.985
She always used to side with my third sister, Wei Chan.

537
33:35.065 --> 33:36.985
Knowing I had no parents to protect me,

538
33:37.065 --> 33:39.025
she'd constantly speak ill of me to Grandmother.

539
33:40.305 --> 33:42.785
Now she's demanding to see my maternal grandmother.

540
33:43.305 --> 33:45.265
Who knows what lies she'll tell about me?

541
33:46.265 --> 33:47.305
I need to question her first.

542
33:47.385 --> 33:49.065
I tried both coaxing and threatening,

543
33:49.145 --> 33:50.585
yet I still couldn't get a word out of her.

544
33:51.105 --> 33:51.985
How do you plan to question her?

545
33:52.065 --> 33:53.705
I have my ways.

546
33:54.705 --> 33:56.305
Don't worry, Brother Jue.

547
33:56.985 --> 33:59.425
You should go. Go on.

548
34:00.665 --> 34:02.385
If you don't, I'll get angry.

549
34:04.745 --> 34:07.425
You two, keep an eye on that old woman inside.

550
34:07.505 --> 34:08.945
Don't let her hurt Her Ladyship.

551
34:09.905 --> 34:10.744
-Yes. -Yes.

552
34:17.585 --> 34:19.025
Take her to the rear hill.

553
34:28.505 --> 34:30.185
I said I want to question her alone.

554
34:30.945 --> 34:32.264
Don't you understand?

555
34:33.225 --> 34:34.105
-Understood. -Understood.

556
34:48.985 --> 34:49.905
Lady Rao.

557
34:50.985 --> 34:51.824
My Lady…

558
34:52.545 --> 34:53.385
Please spare me, My Lady!

559
34:54.385 --> 34:55.465
My Lady…

560
34:55.545 --> 34:58.185
Please spare me! I don't want to die.

561
34:58.265 --> 35:01.505
You've served Aunt Yufeng for so many years.

562
35:02.265 --> 35:04.465
You should know how domineering I can be.

563
35:05.065 --> 35:09.185
Every insolent old servant in the household has learned to obey me.

564
35:09.265 --> 35:13.705
Answer what I ask you today and tell me the truth.

565
35:14.505 --> 35:16.265
If a single word is false,

566
35:16.865 --> 35:18.825
I'll slice off your flesh and feed it to the wolves.

567
35:23.945 --> 35:26.385
What secret were you going to tell my maternal grandmother?

568
35:27.105 --> 35:28.345
Nothing. I wouldn't dare…

569
35:30.345 --> 35:31.825
If you still won't talk,

570
35:32.865 --> 35:34.425
I'll aim it at your eyes.

571
35:35.465 --> 35:37.265
I'll talk!

572
35:38.385 --> 35:39.305
I'll tell you.

573
35:40.345 --> 35:41.945
I'll tell you everything!

574
35:44.505 --> 35:46.785
My Lady, back then…

575
35:48.985 --> 35:51.425
when you went missing at the lantern market,

576
35:52.305 --> 35:55.385
it was Lady Heng'e who had you abandoned!

577
35:55.465 --> 35:56.305
Nonsense!

578
35:57.345 --> 35:59.985
-Aunt Heng'e has always treasured me… -I swear to Heaven!

579
36:00.065 --> 36:01.825
Wet Nurse Zhang, who carried you out that day,

580
36:01.905 --> 36:03.745
had been bribed by her.

581
36:04.265 --> 36:05.785
I saw it with my own eyes.

582
36:07.145 --> 36:07.985
Pick one.

583
36:09.305 --> 36:10.625
-Pick one for the child. -Do you like it?

584
36:12.945 --> 36:14.985
-Bravo! -Bravo!

585
36:15.065 --> 36:16.105
YOUNG WEI RAO

586
36:16.185 --> 36:17.305
Which one do you like?

587
36:17.385 --> 36:19.025
Lady Rao's shoe is missing. Split up and look for it.

588
36:19.105 --> 36:20.265
-My Lady, have another look. -Quick! Search around the back.

589
36:20.345 --> 36:21.585
You two, come with me over there.

590
36:21.665 --> 36:22.585
-All right. -Search over there.

591
36:22.665 --> 36:23.505
-Let's go this way. -Come take a look.

592
36:23.585 --> 36:24.385
Bravo!

593
36:24.465 --> 36:25.705
Pick one.

594
36:27.945 --> 36:29.465
This shoe is quite nice.

595
36:29.545 --> 36:32.345
Lady Rao!

596
36:32.425 --> 36:35.065
Lady Rao, where are you?

597
36:35.145 --> 36:36.385
Lady Rao!

598
36:37.185 --> 36:38.625
Lady Rao!

599
36:41.345 --> 36:43.785
The Dowager Lady reported it to the authorities.

600
36:43.865 --> 36:45.905
Everyone in the city was talking about it.

601
36:45.985 --> 36:47.705
The wet nurse and the guard fled for fear of punishment

602
36:47.785 --> 36:50.225
and ran into bandits at the South Mountain.

603
36:51.065 --> 36:53.145
Both got what they deserved and died.

604
36:53.225 --> 36:55.065
Neither survived.

605
36:57.105 --> 36:58.745
Why would Aunt Heng'e do that?

606
36:58.825 --> 37:03.305
Your aunt blamed your mother for your father's death on the battlefield,

607
37:03.385 --> 37:04.225
so…

608
37:04.865 --> 37:07.065
She acted rashly in a moment of anger.

609
37:07.145 --> 37:08.865
Fortunately, you were blessed with good fortune

610
37:08.945 --> 37:10.305
and were eventually found again.

611
37:10.385 --> 37:13.425
Your aunt deeply regretted it and tried her best to make amends.

612
37:13.505 --> 37:15.105
I'm only a servant.

613
37:15.185 --> 37:17.865
How could I dare say anything more?

614
37:17.945 --> 37:20.585
You insisted on seeing my maternal grandmother

615
37:22.265 --> 37:24.145
just to tell her this?

616
37:25.025 --> 37:27.065
You kept silent all these years.

617
37:29.665 --> 37:31.705
Why speak up now?

618
37:32.225 --> 37:33.585
My Lady, there's something you don't know.

619
37:34.185 --> 37:37.105
I… I've always had a gambling problem.

620
37:37.625 --> 37:42.265
I was short of money recently and stole some gold items from Lady Guo.

621
37:42.345 --> 37:44.785
Now Madam has started asking questions,

622
37:44.865 --> 37:48.145
so I hoped to use this secret to get some travel money

623
37:48.225 --> 37:49.785
from Lady Shou'an and return home.

624
37:50.585 --> 37:51.945
Please show mercy, My Lady.

625
37:52.025 --> 37:53.905
Please spare me!

626
37:55.185 --> 37:57.985
Please don't tell Lady Heng'e.

627
37:58.065 --> 37:59.985
She'll beat me to death.

628
38:00.505 --> 38:03.785
I only wanted to swindle some money.

629
38:03.865 --> 38:05.945
I never meant to hurt anyone.

630
38:06.025 --> 38:09.465
My Lady, please let me go home.

631
38:09.545 --> 38:11.465
I'll kowtow to you!

632
38:12.065 --> 38:13.465
Please let me go home!

633
38:15.585 --> 38:18.145
-My Lady… -You're scared over something so small?

634
38:18.225 --> 38:20.145
-Get up. -Yes.

635
38:23.305 --> 38:24.905
I'll give you some money.

636
38:25.625 --> 38:26.985
Go home on your own.

637
38:28.705 --> 38:31.625
You're so merciful, Lady Rao.

638
38:32.465 --> 38:33.985
You're a living bodhisattva!

639
38:35.065 --> 38:36.385
My Lady…

640
38:38.745 --> 38:39.705
You're lying to me.

641
38:39.785 --> 38:41.065
I'm not.

642
38:41.865 --> 38:43.825
-Please, My Lady! -Help!

643
38:44.905 --> 38:47.425
-Help! -I did nothing!

644
38:47.945 --> 38:49.025
Help!

645
38:49.105 --> 38:50.545
Please don't, My Lady!

646
38:50.625 --> 38:51.785
I didn't do anything!

647
38:57.985 --> 38:59.345
Hurry and report this to Master Huo.

648
38:59.425 --> 39:00.345
-Go! -I didn't mean to do this.

649
39:00.425 --> 39:02.425
-Yes. -I didn't mean to do this.

650
39:07.625 --> 39:08.545
Aunt Yufeng said

651
39:08.625 --> 39:10.665
you were going to complain about me to my maternal grandmother.

652
39:11.185 --> 39:14.425
Whatever you planned to tell her, I won't allow it.

653
39:15.665 --> 39:17.305
Since you won't tell me the truth,

654
39:18.705 --> 39:20.425
then you can die.

655
39:21.625 --> 39:25.025
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

656
39:32.065 --> 39:34.145
Those scoundrels dared to ambush us?

657
39:35.265 --> 39:37.305
I'll bash his head in tomorrow.

658
39:38.305 --> 39:39.465
Easy!

659
39:39.545 --> 39:41.905
Can't you go back to your own residence to have that treated?

660
39:42.865 --> 39:44.345
Have you no heart?

661
39:44.425 --> 39:45.465
Forgot how I got hurt?

662
39:46.785 --> 39:48.265
My Lady, please wait.

663
39:48.785 --> 39:50.465
His Lordship isn't inside.

664
39:52.585 --> 39:55.345
Didn't he just return from Mount Yaowang?

665
39:55.425 --> 39:56.985
I have urgent matters to talk to him.

666
39:57.065 --> 39:59.425
My Lady, His Lordship really isn't inside.

667
40:16.265 --> 40:17.705
I didn't know General Qi was here.

668
40:17.785 --> 40:18.745
Forgive the intrusion.

669
40:19.265 --> 40:21.265
No harm done. It was an honest mistake.

670
40:28.105 --> 40:28.985
What is it?

671
40:29.585 --> 40:30.705
All right, I'm dressed.

672
40:35.225 --> 40:37.905
I heard there was trouble at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

673
40:38.425 --> 40:39.665
I came to ask what happened.

674
40:40.345 --> 40:41.665
It's just displaced people causing trouble.

675
40:41.745 --> 40:43.825
It'll be settled within a couple of days.

676
40:43.905 --> 40:45.025
You needn't worry.

677
40:47.825 --> 40:49.985
Those people aren't honest farmers who lost their land.

678
40:50.065 --> 40:53.185
Han Liao incited the local thugs among them to seize the fields.

679
40:53.265 --> 40:54.465
Farmers can't work on it.

680
40:55.385 --> 40:57.425
He even had the only irrigation channel blocked.

681
40:57.505 --> 41:00.305
With the water cut off, people and livestock will die of thirst,

682
41:01.225 --> 41:02.785
and the crops can't be watered.

683
41:03.985 --> 41:05.625
Qi Zhongkai and I went there today.

684
41:06.585 --> 41:08.265
Han Liao kept hiding and refused to face us,

685
41:08.945 --> 41:10.825
using the displaced people as human shields.

686
41:10.905 --> 41:13.865
If he'd fight me head-on, I wouldn't be afraid.

687
41:13.945 --> 41:15.105
But Lu Zhuo kept holding me back,

688
41:15.185 --> 41:17.585
leaving me unable to fight properly, and I ended up getting hurt.

689
41:18.305 --> 41:20.625
I've never suffered such humiliation even on the battlefield.

690
41:21.705 --> 41:22.625
How could I not stop you?

691
41:22.705 --> 41:25.865
Those people may be carrying hoes and machetes,

692
41:25.945 --> 41:27.385
but they're still civilians.

693
41:27.985 --> 41:29.265
Farm tools aren't weapons of war.

694
41:29.865 --> 41:31.265
You're a battle-hardened general.

695
41:31.345 --> 41:32.785
You don't know your own strength.

696
41:33.305 --> 41:34.145
Injured even one of them,

697
41:34.865 --> 41:36.185
and you'll fall right into Han Liao's trap.

698
41:37.545 --> 41:41.305
Then he'll step forward to seek justice for them

699
41:41.385 --> 41:43.465
and accuse Noble Lady Wu'an of killing civilians.

700
41:44.385 --> 41:45.905
You'll have dragged her into trouble.

701
41:49.425 --> 41:51.305
Thank you, Lord Lu, for thinking of me

702
41:51.825 --> 41:52.825
and putting up with that villain.

703
41:54.185 --> 41:57.585
And thank you, General Qi, for standing up for me.

704
41:57.665 --> 41:59.105
I won't forget your kindness.

705
42:01.345 --> 42:02.465
Enough complimenting him.

706
42:03.545 --> 42:05.105
Han Liao puts the displaced out front

707
42:05.705 --> 42:07.625
and hides behind, raking in the benefits.

708
42:08.585 --> 42:10.905
Brute force alone won't solve this.

709
42:11.585 --> 42:13.225
Then I'll report him to His Majesty!

710
42:13.305 --> 42:14.145
-No, we can't. -No, we can't.

711
42:19.785 --> 42:20.625
Absolutely not.

712
42:22.105 --> 42:23.145
I may know little about politics,

713
42:23.745 --> 42:26.745
but I've heard Mother say that since ancient times,

714
42:26.825 --> 42:29.305
only daughters of princes could be made Noble Ladies.

715
42:30.705 --> 42:33.945
I was granted the title so suddenly that people are bound to question it.

716
42:35.265 --> 42:37.145
If I take this local unrest to His Majesty,

717
42:38.025 --> 42:40.145
people will only say I'm talentless and unfit

718
42:40.225 --> 42:42.025
-for such responsibility. -But you…

719
42:42.105 --> 42:44.145
Your good deeds won you those lands and tenants,

720
42:44.665 --> 42:46.665
and His Majesty bestowed that title on you.

721
42:47.345 --> 42:48.185
But…

722
42:52.785 --> 42:54.785
…whether you can be a good female thane

723
42:57.625 --> 42:59.465
ultimately depends on your own ability.

724
43:02.305 --> 43:03.865
A female thane.

725
43:10.985 --> 43:12.785
I like the sound of that.

726
43:25.265 --> 43:26.305
Quick, fetch the physician!

727
43:26.825 --> 43:27.665
Yes.

728
43:28.985 --> 43:30.105
What exactly happened?

729
43:31.025 --> 43:33.425
This old woman fled in the middle of the night.

730
43:34.105 --> 43:36.185
She must have stolen from my family.

731
43:36.745 --> 43:38.185
I only meant to frighten her a little.

732
43:39.145 --> 43:41.385
I said I'd turn her over to the authorities

733
43:41.465 --> 43:42.945
and have her given 30 strokes.

734
43:43.785 --> 43:45.905
Then she turned vicious and tried to kill me.

735
43:46.425 --> 43:50.265
We struggled, and she lost her footing and tumbled down the slope.

736
43:54.745 --> 43:56.905
If you don't believe me, ask him.

737
43:57.985 --> 43:58.905
Yes.

738
43:58.985 --> 44:00.385
We saw it with our own eyes.

739
44:00.465 --> 44:02.185
That woman pulled a knife and tried to harm Her Ladyship.

740
44:03.185 --> 44:04.265
Brother Jue,

741
44:06.145 --> 44:07.585
she's a runaway servant from the Wei family.

742
44:08.265 --> 44:10.105
If you harbor her without permission

743
44:10.185 --> 44:12.985
and my grandmother finds out, there'll be trouble,

744
44:13.585 --> 44:15.305
and it'll only deepen the rift between our two families.

745
44:15.825 --> 44:17.225
In my view,

746
44:18.905 --> 44:20.945
we should carry her back to the Wei Residence

747
44:21.025 --> 44:22.305
and hand her over to Aunt Yufeng.

748
44:26.705 --> 44:28.625
What rift?

749
44:30.065 --> 44:31.145
Grandmother.

750
44:36.505 --> 44:38.745
Didn't you go to bed already?

751
44:38.825 --> 44:40.225
What brought you here?

752
44:41.065 --> 44:43.465
Brother Jue caught a runaway servant from the Wei family.

753
44:43.545 --> 44:45.665
I was just urging him to send her back.

754
44:47.585 --> 44:49.545
The Wei family really is looking for her.

755
44:50.425 --> 44:51.505
Rao questioned her in private,

756
44:52.105 --> 44:55.665
but the woman panicked and lost her footing on the steep slope.

757
44:55.745 --> 44:57.465
Now she looks close to death.

758
44:58.265 --> 44:59.265
Grandmother…

759
45:00.785 --> 45:01.905
Let me see her.

760
45:02.505 --> 45:03.585
Grandmother,

761
45:03.665 --> 45:05.865
the smell of blood is strong in here.

762
45:06.705 --> 45:07.705
I'm afraid it may upset you.

763
45:08.545 --> 45:10.985
Why don't we wait until the physician has checked on her?

764
45:11.065 --> 45:12.265
Then I'll let you know.

765
45:14.145 --> 45:17.505
I know you're concerned for me.

766
45:17.585 --> 45:21.825
But I have weathered more storms than you can imagine.

767
45:21.905 --> 45:25.065
Do you think this can frighten me?

768
45:32.225 --> 45:33.545
Do you have something to say?

769
45:33.625 --> 45:35.105
Lady Shou'an is here.

770
45:35.185 --> 45:36.145
Say whatever you want to say.

771
45:49.985 --> 45:50.905
She…

772
45:54.625 --> 45:56.665
She's an impostor.

773
48:13.945 --> 48:16.705
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
